{
  "comment": [
    "One palette and scale, two pages, both built here: the panel compiles these into",
    "custom properties on its shadow host, and the trace replay page is built with the",
    "same properties inlined. Contrast ratios are asserted by tests/tokens.unit.test.ts,",
    "so a colour cannot be changed into an inaccessible one without a gate going red.",
    "Dark is defined outright, not derived by inversion."
  ],
  "scale": {
    "space": "4px",
    "font-size": "14px",
    "font-size-small": "13px",
    "font-size-title": "16px",
    "font-size-meta": "12px",
    "font-size-micro": "11px",
    "font-size-display": "20px",
    "font-size-hero": "24px",
    "font-size-field-touch": "16px",
    "line-height": "1.6",
    "line-height-heading": "1.35",
    "line-height-tight": "1",
    "line-height-prose": "1.7",
    "line-height-code": "1.6",
    "radius-flush": "0px",
    "radius-inline": "4px",
    "radius-control": "8px",
    "radius-card": "12px",
    "radius-panel": "12px",
    "radius-window": "16px",
    "radius-field": "16px",
    "radius-pill": "999px",
    "border-width": "1px",
    "motion-fast": "120ms",
    "motion-base": "180ms",
    "motion-easing": "cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)",
    "font-stack": "Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif",
    "mono-stack": "ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, 'SF Mono', Menlo, Consolas, monospace"
  },
  "themes": {
